        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo 22, 18 Inch Commercial Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis 18\" Center to Center (CTC)  commercial door pull is made from 1\" diameter solid round bar stock. The easy use and clean style makes it great for any office, hospital, school, or store front doors. Packaged with mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-22_size.gif?v=1704354600\" width=\"580\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo 22 Door Pull size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/8-inch-commercial-door-pull-don-jo-19\"><b>8\" Door Pull</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/10-inch-commercial-door-pull-don-jo-20\"><b>10\" Door Pull</b></a>,  <a href=\"/products/12-inch-commercial-door-pull-don-jo-21\"><b>12\" Door Pull</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text\">\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Don-Jo 22 18\" Commercial Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center (CTC): 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Pull Length: 19\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Bar Stock</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">ADA Compliant</a></li>\r\n<li>Packaged with Mounting Hardware</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/22.pdf?v=1704262237\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo 22 Door Pull Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Material and Finish</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n\r\n<li><b>Solid Aluminum:</b></li>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Available in Clear Anodized Aluminum finishes</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<li><b>Solid Brass:</b></li>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Available in Polished Brass finishes</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<li><b>Solid Bronze:</b></li>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Available in Oil Rubbed Bronze finish</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<li><b>Solid Stainless Steel:</b></li>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Polished Stainless Steel or Satin Stainless Steel finishes</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "18 Inch Commercial Door Pull, Don-Jo 22",
                "description": "Don-Jo 22 - Standard 1 inch diameter  solid bar stock 18 inch Center to Center (CTC) Commercial Door Pulls. Available in your choice of 5 different finish colors.",
